# Private and generated data
# Keep documentation and placeholders trackable, but never commit data files.
data/**
!data/**/
!data/**/README*
!data/**/.gitkeep

# Private extensionless mailbox exports outside data/
**/[Pp]osteingang_*
/[Ss]pam_*
**/[Ss]pamverdacht_*

# Mailbox files and email-client profile data outside data/
*.mbox
*.mbx
*.eml
*.emlx
*.maildir/
Maildir/
**/.thunderbird/
**/Thunderbird/Profiles/
**/ImapMail/
**/global-messages-db.sqlite
*.msf

# Except the fully synthetic .eml test fixtures, which must be trackable.
!tests/fixtures/eml/*.eml

